<title>USA: FREE TO TRADE -- Nebraska Hospital.</title>
<headline>FREE TO TRADE -- Nebraska Hospital.</headline>
<text>
<p>HOSPITAL AUTHORITY NO. 1 OF DOUGLAS COUNTY,</p>
<p>RE: $57,965,000</p>
<p>NEBRASKA HOSPITAL REVENUE AND REFUNDING BONDS,</p>
<p>SERIES 1997</p>
<p>(ALEGENT HEALTH - IMMANUEL MEDICAL CENTER PROJECT)</p>
<p>Effective immediately all syndicate terms and price</p>
<p>restrictions are removed and the bonds are free to trade.</p>
<p>Smith Barney Inc.</p>
<p>Kirkpatrick, Pettis, Smith, Polian, Inc.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
